# Amity Square (decomp scripts_amity_square.s, scrcmd_amity_square.c): Pikachu is allowed to walk along. Stepping in
# at the west gate, the receptionist's YES sends it out to follow (MOVEMENT_TYPE_FOLLOW_PLAYER, SetHasPartner); after
# 200 steps (SystemVars_IncrementAmitySquareStepCount, cleared on entry) talking to it hands over what it found: an
# accessory from Pikachu's pool (CalcAmitySquareFoundAccessory) or, one time in five, a berry; RECORD_UNK_051 counts
# it. Walking back out ends the stroll.
party 0 platinum:SPECIES_PIKACHU 20 platinum:MOVE_THUNDER_SHOCK
warp platinum:MAP_HEADER_AMITY_SQUARE 12 47 up
until idle
+0 press up
until position 12 46
+0 release up
advance text
until yesno
+2 press a
+1 release a
advance text 600
until idle
+0 assert state vars.platinum:VAR_FOLLOWER_MON_ACTIVE 1
+0 assert state hasPartner true
+0 screenshot amity-follower
# Up and down the lawn, 4 tiles each way.
+0 press up
until position 12 41
+0 release up
+0 press down
until position 12 44
+0 release down
+0 press up
until position 12 41
+0 release up
+0 press down
